@startuml
!include style.puml
left to right direction

title Undo and redo history after saved contact changes

skinparam State {
    BackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR_T1
    BorderColor MODEL_COLOR
    FontColor #000000
}

state "After two changes\ncurrent = C\nundo = [A, B]\nredo = []" as Latest
state "After undo\ncurrent = B\nundo = [A]\nredo = [C]" as Undone
state "After branching change\ncurrent = D\nundo = [A, B]\nredo = []" as Branched

Latest --> Undone : undo()\nrestore B and save
Undone --> Latest : redo()\nrestore C and save
Undone --> Branched : new real contact change\nsave succeeds
Undone --> Undone : read-only or no-op command;\nfailed command or save

note bottom of Undone
  The rightmost entry is the top of each stack.
  A, B, and C are saved contact states with
  selection, filter, sort, and activity times.
  A failed redo save also returns to this state.
end note

note bottom of Branched
  The new mutation clears redo history.
  The discarded C state cannot be redone.
end note

@enduml
